Flow User enters Jack Hunt app

  Entry App launch

  Screen Login options

    Shows
      Welcome video as background
      Welcome message
      Continue with Google button
      Continue with Apple button
      Continue with email link

  Once authentication state is known
    If User is not logged in
      Go to Login options
    Otherwise
      Go to Load signed-in experience

  Action Load signed-in experience

    Receives
      userId from onAuthStateChange data

    Rules
      Session owns the conversation

    Uses
      Firestore for conversation and session history
      @capacitor-firebase/messaging for push notifications

    Steps
      Hide the splash screen

      At the same time
        Load the cart
        Register the device for push notifications
        Go to Get or create a session
